{{/* The keys sentence of the keyed tier: today's branches on SelfServe, Auth and the number of keyed tools. */}}
{{define "keysNote"}}{{if .SelfServe}}Free: run <code>/apikey create</code> in the <a href="https://discord.gg/XZzkH38dt9">EVE-Cyno Discord</a>, or sign in on ai.eve-cyno.dev → Settings → Data API keys. Without a key {{if eq (len .Tools.Keyed) 1}}this answers{{else}}these answer{{end}} <code>401 api_key_required</code>.{{else if .Auth}}Keys are issued by the operator of this service. Without a key {{if eq (len .Tools.Keyed) 1}}this answers{{else}}these answer{{end}} <code>401 api_key_required</code>.{{else}}No keys are issued yet; {{if eq (len .Tools.Keyed) 1}}this answers{{else}}these answer{{end}} <code>401 api_key_required</code>.{{end}}{{if .Auth}} Free-text fit search (<code>q</code> on <code>{{.Prefix}}/fits/search</code>) needs a key too; the filters do not.{{end}}{{end}}

{{define "keyLimits"}}{{if .Auth}}{{if or .AnonCap .KeyCap}}Over the daily cap: <code>429 daily_quota_exceeded</code>, with <code>Retry-After</code> set to the seconds until 00:00 UTC. {{end}}{{end}}{{end}}
